```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Клиент
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant BS as Booking Service
    participant SS as Schedule Service
    participant SubS as Subscription Service
    participant MQ as Message Broker
    participant NS as Notification Service

    Client->>GW: POST /bookings {slotId, userId}
    GW->>GW: Проверка JWT-токена
    GW->>BS: POST /bookings {slotId, userId}

    BS->>SS: GET /slots/{slotId}
    SS-->>BS: 200 OK {availableSlots: 3, trainerId, datetime}

    BS->>SubS: GET /subscriptions/{userId}/active
    SubS-->>BS: 200 OK {subscriptionId, validUntil, sessionsLeft: 5}

    alt Места есть и абонемент активен
        BS->>BS: Создать запись, уменьшить availableSlots
        BS->>MQ: Publish event: booking.created {bookingId, userId, slotId}
        BS-->>GW: 201 Created {bookingId, datetime, trainer}
        GW-->>Client: 201 Created {bookingId, datetime, trainer}

        MQ->>NS: Event: booking.created
        NS->>Client: Push/Email "Вы записаны на занятие {datetime}"
    else Нет свободных мест
        BS-->>GW: 409 Conflict {error: "no_available_slots", waitlistAvailable: true}
        GW-->>Client: 409 Conflict — предложение встать в очередь
    else Абонемент неактивен или закончились сессии
        BS-->>GW: 403 Forbidden {error: "subscription_invalid"}
        GW-->>Client: 403 Forbidden — требуется продление абонемента
    end
```
